Didn't you say you went out?

13
00:01:32.234 --> 00:01:33.827
Then I have to indicate that I left?

14
00:01:34.467 --> 00:01:35.534
Is that right?

15
00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:36.563
What is it

16
00:01:37.033 --> 00:01:38.534
Sabi Kim is truly a genius.

17
00:01:38.601 --> 00:01:40.200
(Sabi) I heard they also put a balloon inside the uterus?

18
00:01:40.267 --> 00:01:41.201
That's missing too

19
00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:42.703
(Lee Young) Yes

20
00:01:44.567 --> 00:01:45.966
(Sabi) And as I saw earlier,

21
00:01:46.033 --> 00:01:48.133
There was a typo in Kim Shin-woo’s maternal chart?

22
00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:49.100
where?

23
00:01:49.167 --> 00:01:50.080
Did you see everything?

24
00:01:51.171 --> 00:01:53.033
(Sabi) It’s in the middle.

25
00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:54.534
That's a doppler

26
00:01:54.601 --> 00:01:56.567
doppl, is that right?

27
00:01:56.634 --> 00:01:58.034
(private) D is a capital letter

28
00:01:58.101 --> 00:01:59.500
Because it's a word that comes from a person's name

29
