It's correct if it starts with a capital letter.

30
00:02:01.234 --> 00:02:04.024
[Program operation sound effect]

31
00:02:04.091 --> 00:02:05.926
That's right, that's right

32
00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:07.895
Thank you, thank you

33
00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:09.796
[Messenger incoming sound]

34
