I'm afraid you'll get scolded again

35
00:02:15.869 --> 00:02:17.838
(Sabi) It’s pretty hard to even watch that.

36
00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:20.467
Ask often

37
00:02:20.534 --> 00:02:23.043
I like teaching and helping.

38
00:02:23.734 --> 00:02:25.267
You too will be able to do well soon.

39
00:02:25.334 --> 00:02:26.413
Yeah, yeah

40
00:02:27.214 --> 00:02:28.715
[Messenger incoming sound]

41
00:02:30.133 --> 00:02:31.467
(Jooyoung) Arrive at the lobby in 5 minutes

42
00:02:31.534 --> 00:02:32.867
Come down on time

43
00:02:32.934 --> 00:02:34.000
[Keyboard operation sound]

44
00:02:34.067 --> 00:02:35.255
Oh, why did you come?

45
00:02:35.322 --> 00:02:36.500
[Sound of door opening]
(Jaeil) Hey, hey, hey!

46
00:02:36.567 --> 00:02:38.158
- It's finally out.
- (Nanjing) What is it?

47
00:02:39.725 --> 00:02:41.061
(Japan) Salty
[Nankyung’s surprised gasp]

48
00:02:41.128 --> 00:02:42.229
Look at this

49
00:02:42.296 --> 00:02:43.330
(Nanjing) Oh

50
00:02:43.397 --> 00:02:45.198
(Jaeil) Look, it came out well, right? Look look

51
00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:47.767
(Savi) Oh I-young

52
00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:49.933
(Namkyung) Oh Yi-young did Oh Yi-young, right?

53
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.772
Anyway, I don't really listen to what you say.

54
00:02:51.839 --> 00:02:53.473
When you take a picture, take a good picture

55
00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:55.233
It's an old jump shot from some time ago.

56
00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:57.600
Don’t you know that classics are forever?

57
00:02:57.667 --> 00:02:59.746
(Japan) I feel embarrassed, no matter what I do
Is it good to take a picture?

58
00:03:00.234 --> 00:03:01.314
If it weren't for you guys

59
00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:04.033
Without these memories
I almost missed my first year

60
00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:05.000
[cell phone vibrating sound]

61
00:03:05.067 --> 00:03:06.119
Every year from now on

62
00:03:06.632 --> 00:03:08.033
Let's take one picture at a time

63
00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:09.323
And in the second year

64
00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:11.224
someone is calling

65
00:03:16.701 --> 00:03:17.731
[Lee Young sighs]

66
00:03:18.267 --> 00:03:19.266
go now

67
00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:21.168
[Call end sound]

68
00:03:22.032 --> 00:03:23.170
(Lee Young) I’ll go out for a moment and come back.

69
00:03:23.237 --> 00:03:24.170
- (Namkyung) Huh?
- (Sabi) Where?

70
00:03:24.237 --> 00:03:25.667
- (Lee Young) Meet someone
- (Nanjing) Who?

71
00:03:25.734 --> 00:03:27.307
(Lee Young) Ah, there is someone I know.

72
00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:29.509
There are so many questions

73
00:03:30.544 --> 00:03:33.146
Whenever he talks about his second year,
Where do you keep going?

74
00:03:33.747 --> 00:03:34.795
(Nanjing) Hehehe

75
00:03:42.667 --> 00:03:44.625
Oh, I forgot the anti-adhesion agent.

76
00:03:47.882 --> 00:03:49.367
(Sabi) Huh?

77
00:03:49.434 --> 00:03:50.864
He didn't log out

78
00:03:52.997 --> 00:03:54.401
[Messenger incoming sound]

79
00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:59.573
(Jooyoung) Come with your friends
I'll buy you food

80
00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:01.400
(Lee Young) Oh, I’m not your friend.

81
00:04:01.467 --> 00:04:02.676
just a coworker

82
00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:04.978
I'm going to quit soon, but what about my friend?

83
00:04:08.649 --> 00:04:10.517
(Jooyoung) Ugh, hateful baby

84
00:04:10.584 --> 00:04:12.653
So I don't have any friends in my life

85
00:04:13.153 --> 00:04:14.955
(Lee Young) Oh, I really
I said I don't think I can do it, sister.

86
00:04:17.311 --> 00:04:18.492
(Jooyoung) Stop it

87
00:04:19.267 --> 00:04:20.367
(Lee Young) Really?

88
00:04:20.434 --> 00:04:21.700
So should I quit today?

89
00:04:21.767 --> 00:04:22.729
Or tomorrow?

90
00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:24.834
(Jaeil) I’m just saying this.

91
00:04:24.901 --> 00:04:26.667
Everyone lives with at least one resignation letter.

92
00:04:27.167 --> 00:04:28.168
(Sabi) Why are you resigning?

93
00:04:28.648 --> 00:04:29.770
[lively music]

94
00:04:29.837 --> 00:04:30.837
[Nanjing’s sigh]

95
00:04:30.904 --> 00:04:32.233
(Nanjing) Leave it alone

96
00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:33.867
If you quit, you will lose money.

97
00:04:33.934 --> 00:04:35.300
What does it have to do with me?

98
00:04:35.367 --> 00:04:37.778
Do the 3rd residency training.
[Nankyung snorts]

99
00:04:37.845 --> 00:04:39.634
(Sabi) I hope Lee Young doesn’t quit

100
00:04:39.701 --> 00:04:42.233
I also help with charting
I can help you with your studies too.

101
00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:43.550
(Jaeil) Oh, oh, oh!

102
00:04:43.617 --> 00:04:45.567
Please help me too

103
00:04:45.634 --> 00:04:48.188
I think I'll be fired before I even resign.

104
00:04:48.255 --> 00:04:51.558
If you don't have enough major, you won't be fired.
[Humorous sound effects]

105
00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:53.167
Ah...

106
00:04:53.234 --> 00:04:54.561
[makes a squeak]

107
00:04:54.628 --> 00:04:57.464
The only things you know to say are facts.

108
00:04:58.601 --> 00:05:01.688
(Nanjing) [Sighing] Different
I use language

109
00:05:01.755 --> 00:05:03.369
There's no way we can talk to each other

110
00:05:03.436 --> 00:05:05.271
- Ugh!
- (Namkyung) I’m surprised.
[humorous music]

111
00:05:05.338 --> 00:05:06.233
(Japan) Oh I-young!

112
00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:07.607
Did you throw this away?

113
00:05:08.267 --> 00:05:10.844
I picked it with great difficulty, Mr. Lee.

114
00:05:10.911 --> 00:05:12.412
I must have fallen, when I was leaving earlier.

115
00:05:14.314 --> 00:05:15.867
At times like this, I’m human again.

116
00:05:15.934 --> 00:05:17.250
[Program operation sound effect]

117
00:05:21.267 --> 00:05:23.356
No, who says quit now?

118
00:05:24.291 --> 00:05:27.567
Any medical resident must wear a gown.
I live with a resignation letter in my arms

119
00:05:27.634 --> 00:05:28.595
Right?

120
00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:32.799
You also have a small amount of conscience
You have a very small amount of mental intelligence, right?

121
00:05:32.866 --> 00:05:34.500
Well, of course

122
00:05:34.567 --> 00:05:36.937
Oh, otherwise I can’t do this job.

123
00:05:38.705 --> 00:05:40.707
(Lee Young) Why is Jjansuni flexing?

124
00:05:41.534 --> 00:05:42.567
(Jooyoung) I didn’t buy it

125
00:05:42.634 --> 00:05:43.977
Master bought it for me and left.

126
00:05:44.545 --> 00:05:46.335
[humorous music]
This is a signature

127
00:05:46.901 --> 00:05:49.167
This is a new product, what does this say?

128
00:05:49.234 --> 00:05:50.283
Goo Do-won’s favorite

129
00:05:50.817 --> 00:05:53.887
Huh, I went to a hospital and I know everything.

130
00:05:55.689 --> 00:05:57.157
(Lee Young) It’s also my favorite

131
00:05:57.224 --> 00:06:00.374
(Jooyoung) Ugh, you bread ghost!
eat it all

132
00:06:05.732 --> 00:06:08.034
It would have been nice if you had eaten together, Mr.

133
00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:11.037
I'm not busy at all today
He said eat and go

134
00:06:12.306 --> 00:06:13.406
Is it an emergency?

135
00:06:13.473 --> 00:06:15.000
Would I be here if it was an emergency?

136
00:06:15.067 --> 00:06:16.009
That's right

137
00:06:18.334 --> 00:06:19.400
Did you say I was coming?

138
00:06:19.467 --> 00:06:21.481
(Jooyoung) You? You said you were coming

139
00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:24.317
Did you fight?

140
00:06:24.785 --> 00:06:25.618
no

141
00:06:25.685 --> 00:06:26.653
Are you scolded?

142
00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:27.587
(Lee Young) Isn’t it?

143
00:06:27.654 --> 00:06:29.333
- (Jooyoung) Ah, do well!
- You're doing great!

144
00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:30.367
How can you believe that?

145
00:06:30.434 --> 00:06:31.600
Oh, if you don’t want to believe it, don’t believe it.

146
00:06:31.667 --> 00:06:32.901
I just tried it too

147
00:06:32.968 --> 00:06:34.427
Just do this

148
00:06:34.494 --> 00:06:35.901
[sigh]

149
00:06:35.968 --> 00:06:37.430
But why did you really come to the hospital?

150
00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:40.667
(Lee Young) Wow, am I really here to spy on you?

151
00:06:40.734 --> 00:06:42.801
Yeah, I came to see what you were up to.

152
00:06:42.868 --> 00:06:45.700
Sir, now I
It’s minus 41.95 million won.

153
00:06:45.767 --> 00:06:47.500
- (Lee Young) This is all...
- (Jooyoung) Okay!

154
00:06:47.567 --> 00:06:49.476
Don't talk about debt while eating, Chehae

155
00:06:51.611 --> 00:06:52.579
[Jooyoung chuckles]

156
00:06:56.116 --> 00:06:57.167
[sigh]

157
00:07:05.859 --> 00:07:07.460
I'm going to try again

158
00:07:11.167 --> 00:07:12.098
Being a mother

159
00:07:13.467 --> 00:07:15.302
I went to the fertility center today and got counseling.

160
00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.270
Why?

161
00:07:17.337 --> 00:07:18.467
Are you saying you'll never do it again?

162
00:07:18.534 --> 00:07:19.940
After half a year

163
00:07:20.567 --> 00:07:22.434
Are you feeling challenged again?

164
00:07:22.501 --> 00:07:23.834
[Jooyoung’s light smile]
[Calm music]

165
00:07:23.901 --> 00:07:26.513
(Jooyoung) Sseu-eup, I’m still thinking about it.

166
00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:29.749
Giving up after only 4 years
It's a bit disappointing

167
00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:32.752
Before adding the first 4 characters

168
00:07:32.819 --> 00:07:34.654
I wonder if I should try it one more time

169
00:07:36.033 --> 00:07:37.490
I haven't told my brother-in-law yet.

170
00:07:38.158 --> 00:07:39.025
It's a secret

171
00:07:41.734 --> 00:07:42.729
(Lee Young) Just

172
00:07:44.033 --> 00:07:45.692
Raise me well

173
00:07:45.759 --> 00:07:47.267
There's still a long way to go before I become human.

174
00:07:47.334 --> 00:07:48.468
[laughter]

175
00:07:48.535 --> 00:07:49.770
You know, right?

176
00:07:49.837 --> 00:07:51.538
[cell phone ringing sound]

177
00:07:55.576 --> 00:07:56.910
(Jooyoung) Yes, honey

178
00:07:58.779 --> 00:08:02.600
Yes, I came to Jongno and saw you for a moment.

179
00:08:02.667 --> 00:08:03.917
I'm with Lee Young right now.

180
00:08:04.868 --> 00:08:06.119
I asked

181
00:08:07.187 --> 00:08:08.667
He said he didn't go on a blind date.

182
00:08:08.734 --> 00:08:09.801
[humorous music]

183
00:08:09.868 --> 00:08:13.359
Oh, how can I ask that?

184
00:08:13.426 --> 00:08:15.328
Oh, you two are talking, are you a stranger?

185
00:08:18.629 --> 00:08:19.628
Young Lee?

186
00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:22.202
Okay, yeah

187
00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.237
[Call end sound]

188
00:08:24.304 --> 00:08:25.367
What is a blind date?

189
00:08:25.434 --> 00:08:29.876
There's a good person at my brother-in-law's company.
I told him to go on a blind date, but he didn't.

190
00:08:30.577 --> 00:08:31.778
(Lee Young) Uh...

191
00:08:35.934 --> 00:08:38.100
(Jooyoung) Hey, but

192
00:08:38.167 --> 00:08:40.320
Master, is there anyone you can meet at the hospital?

193
00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:43.667
It seemed like there wasn't one...?

194
00:08:43.734 --> 00:08:45.525
Or something...

195
00:08:46.159 --> 00:08:48.300
Rumor has it that you like someone

196
00:08:48.367 --> 00:08:49.863
Is there anyone you like?

197
00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:50.964
No...

198
00:08:51.598 --> 00:08:52.532
Guess what?

199
00:08:53.233 --> 00:08:54.400
(Jooyoung) No

200
00:08:54.467 --> 00:08:56.267
A person who likes our master

201
00:08:56.334 --> 00:08:58.772
Well, who likes it?
Haven't you heard of it?

202
00:08:59.273 --> 00:09:00.941
Oh, I guess there is?

203
00:09:01.008 --> 00:09:01.908
Oh, you don't know?

204
00:09:05.976 --> 00:09:07.013
There is one person

205
00:09:08.916 --> 00:09:10.817
(Jooyoung) Right? Right?

206
00:09:11.385 --> 00:09:12.519
who is this?

207
00:09:13.420 --> 00:09:14.654
Oh, who is it?

208
00:09:15.922 --> 00:09:16.867
[Sound of swallowing]

209
00:09:16.934 --> 00:09:18.934
[nervous music]

210
00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:23.163
I don't know

211
00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:24.233
[Humorous sound effects]

212
00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:25.799
- (Lee Young) How do I know that?
- (Jooyoung) Hey!

213
00:09:26.567 --> 00:09:28.568
I'm surprised, did you get it?

214
00:09:28.635 --> 00:09:30.036
(Jooyoung) Are you saying you know or don’t know?

215
00:09:30.103 --> 00:09:31.337
I'm telling you to stop paying attention.

216
00:09:31.404 --> 00:09:33.974
(Jooyoung) Ah, this guy is real
[cell phone ringing sound]

217
00:09:36.505 --> 00:09:37.815
(Lee Young) Thank you for calling.

218
00:09:38.868 --> 00:09:39.980
I'll be right there

219
00:09:45.085 --> 00:09:46.052
[Jooyoung sighs]

220
00:09:46.119 --> 00:09:48.721
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
'Life as a Major' theme song]

221
00:09:56.263 --> 00:09:58.547
[Sweet music]

222
00:10:08.308 --> 00:10:09.409
[Knocking sound]

223
00:10:09.476 --> 00:10:10.910
Who?
[Sound of door opening]

224
00:10:11.434 --> 00:10:14.066
Knock, I heard a rumor

225
00:10:14.133 --> 00:10:14.981
What rumor?

226
00:10:15.501 --> 00:10:18.518
(Jaeil) You have the same tastes as me

227
00:10:19.419 --> 00:10:21.388
[light music]
[Sparkling sound effect]

228
00:10:26.834 --> 00:10:28.028
i like girls

229
00:10:28.095 --> 00:10:29.128
[Humorous sound effects]
yes?

230
00:10:29.195 --> 00:10:31.066
Oh, me too

231
00:10:31.133 --> 00:10:32.665
I like it a lot too

232
00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:36.236
(Jaeil) Oh, that’s not it
I heard a rumor that you like tennis.

233
00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:39.005
(Dowon) Oh, but?

234
00:10:39.072 --> 00:10:41.033
(Japan) Tsu-eup, Yulje tennis team
Make one

235
00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:43.600
I was wondering if it would be a good idea to hold regular meetings.

236
00:10:43.667 --> 00:10:45.700
Make friends and exercise

237
00:10:45.767 --> 00:10:47.047
It's good to be friends with many students.

238
00:10:49.534 --> 00:10:50.901
Every Friday at 8pm

239
00:10:50.968 --> 00:10:52.367
Oh no, I can't do it that day.

240
00:10:52.434 --> 00:10:54.100
Oh, that's right, Friday!

241
00:10:54.167 --> 00:10:55.100
(Dowon) Do it without me

242
00:10:55.167 --> 00:10:57.424
(Jaeil) Hey, how are you?
You are our team president.

243
00:10:58.532 --> 00:11:00.794
- (Dowon) Me?
- (Jaeil) Yes, that's what I decided.

244
00:11:01.821 --> 00:11:03.867
Me too, not on Friday
I'd like to schedule it for another day.

245
00:11:03.934 --> 00:11:05.801
Everyone, it's Friday at least
Because it’s good to save time

246
00:11:05.868 --> 00:11:08.467
(Do-won) So, do it without me.
I'm busy on Friday

247
00:11:08.534 --> 00:11:10.801
(Jaeil) I know, everyone at the hospital knows.

248
00:11:10.868 --> 00:11:12.600
[Interesting music]
[Clapping hands] It's Friday night

249
00:11:12.667 --> 00:11:13.974
Have lunch at the food court

250
00:11:14.041 --> 00:11:16.343
In the conference room
Get the surgery done next week.

251
00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:18.879
I bought two cans of beer at a convenience store on my way home from work.

252
00:11:18.946 --> 00:11:21.834
Dudung, end Friday night with Netflix

253
00:11:21.901 --> 00:11:24.918
Living a boring life alone and having fun
No fun routine guy

254
00:11:25.664 --> 00:11:26.853
We know everything now

255
00:11:27.688 --> 00:11:28.688
[laughter]

256
00:11:30.424 --> 00:11:31.600
